  "description": "Gravity Gravel Zilla GRX carbon gravel bike: an advanced carbon gravel/adventure bike made for fast mixed-surface riding, gravel roads, rough pavement, chipseal and long endurance rides.\n\nShimano GRX600/800 drivetrain: GRX RX600 2x11 shifters, GRX RX810 front and rear derailleurs, 11-34T 11-speed cassette and FSA Omega 46/30T gravel-specific crank give wide, useful gearing for pavement and gravel.\n\nHydraulic disc control: Shimano GRX hydraulic disc brakes with RX400 calipers and 160mm rotors deliver confident braking through rain, dirt, descents and variable road surfaces.\n\nWide tire carbon platform: the carbon frame and carbon gravel fork use thru-axles, rear rack mounts and Trifecta fork braze-ons, with clearance up to 700x50c / 29x2 inch tires.",
